    "Fields not listed here cannot be submitted as hard constraints.",
    "Missing evidence follows the request's explicit unknown_policy and is never silently converted to a failing value.",
    "A cost ceiling must identify its governed cost concept; generic cost fields are not allowed.",
    "Income-band net-price constraints must use the corresponding governed income-band field; household size is not inferred from institution-level aggregates.",
    "Housing availability and universal residency requirements are separate evidence fields; roommate/private-room configuration is not inferred from federal core data.",
    "Disability-services evidence availability may be filtered, but it must not be interpreted as a service-quality or physical-accessibility score."
